# Optional, for the dev server only: the folder of the owner's prototype of 23 October 2026. When set, `npm run dev`
# also serves it at /prototype/ (its Components.dc.html beside the sample) and its two licensed @font-face rules at
# /prototype-fonts.css, so the sample shows Kinetika and LFT Etica Mono. Nothing is copied into the repository.
HUB_PROTOTYPE=C:/git/hub-prototype
